OL,3,GNEWSANeurodivergent woman's Lego
OL,4,Apassion helps her focus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA neurodivergent woman who estimates
OL,7,Fshe has about #3,000 worth of Lego says
OL,8,Fit helps her focus.
OL,10,FAl Palmer, 23, from near Norwich, has
OL,11,Fautism and ADHD and became interested
OL,12,Fin the brick-building phenomenon as an
OL,13,Fadult during university.
OL,15,FShe said she found the building process
OL,16,F"therapeutic" as it offered her a
OL,17,Fdistraction away from the everyday
OL,18,Fstresses of life.
OL,20,F"It's so therapeutic to do; it takes
OL,21,Fyour mind off of things", she explained
OL,22,Fto BBC Look East.
